    "summary": "Three integration tests: the file store over a real temporary directory with two store instances on one session; the chat panel run over the file store; and the start-up sweep keeping the output files of a session the migration left in globalState. Two code review findings were fixed in this task's scope (commit 5ef06e69): a failed whole-file write no longer leaves its temporary file behind, and the head carries every session field except the transcript. Whole plugin suite on 5ef06e69, run by the builder with `npx tsx --test --test-force-exit --test-isolation=none --test-timeout=20000 --test-reporter=tap 'src/**/__tests__/*.test.ts'` in vscode-plugin: 1135 tests, 1129 pass, 4 skipped, 2 fail, the two being the manifest-catalog tests that failed before this Story; the full TAP output is /tmp/insrc-validate-output/plugin-full-suite-5ef06e69.tap. The real migration ran on the user's machine at 15:06 on 2026-10-12 after a reload; the check's script output is /tmp/insrc-validate-output/chat-migration-check.txt. A dry run on a copy of the state beforehand took about 0.75 s, a first read 29 to 45 ms and a save of one row 0.2 to 0.35 ms.",
